{
  "_doc": "FairValueGuard parameters every deploy sets (A.5.4, PD-2), for every Series on the venue (S24.1: the EXIT grant's floor, Boost, Parlay and Range all read it). \u03c3 in annualized basis points, the seed maker's own defaults (services/ops seed-maker env.ts: BTC 5,000, ETH 6,500, SOL 8,000, stocks 4,500) so the bound and the maker quote one model; turned into sigmaE8 = floor(sqrt(bps^2 * 1e8 / clockYear)) on the Series' clock: `trading` (Regular, inside one session) on tradingYearSec, `calendar` (the 24/7 lanes) on calendarYearSec, `gap` (the weekend Window) so its whole span carries one session's variance: bps^2 * 1e8 * sessionSec / (tradingYearSec * gapSpanSec). `spotFeeds`: the RedStone feed the guard verifies per ticker (one per ticker): the `---24_7` feed where the name has one \u2014 it publishes around the clock, so a Regular Window in session and a 24/7 one off-hours both read it \u2014 else the name's own feed (PLTR and AMD: RedStone publishes no `---24_7` for them, tickers.ts).",
